)
COMMENT = 'Materialized view: pre-filtered projection of DIM_CUSTOMER limited to CUSTOMER_TIER = HIGH_VALUE. Single base table, no joins -- Snowflake materialized views do not support joins, so this stays deliberately within that constraint rather than attempting a cross-table rollup.'
